{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-25","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The rectangle contained by medial straight lines commensurable in square only is either rational or medial.","book":10,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","contentId":"euclid-10-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8e1e81d312c4fcbfce0689dd65ba7d4cf54e7f9dbd34fc59d4409d9a37b9616","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-25.statement","euclid-10-25.construction.1","euclid-10-25.proof.1","euclid-10-25.construction.2","euclid-10-25.proof.2","euclid-10-25.proof.3","euclid-10-25.proof.4","euclid-10-25.proof.5","euclid-10-25.proof.6","euclid-10-25.proof.7","euclid-10-25.proof.8","euclid-10-25.proof.9","euclid-10-25.proof.10","euclid-10-25.proof.11","euclid-10-25.proof.12","euclid-10-25.proof.13","euclid-10-25.proof.14","euclid-10-25.conclusion","euclid-10-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16c5435a583af96a90432e8cfb8cb0c651ab892f9a6e2996f660a4d9d17fe472","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The rectangle contained by medial straight lines commensurable in square only is either rational or medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形由中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度组成,有有理,有中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"783a302074ac0c95ac42eaa2b79739ea6a13bef334a8a425f2d7db8acc3fc5c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the rectangle AC be contained by the medial straight lines AB, BC which are commensurable in square only; I say that AC is either rational or medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由中项无理线段 AB,BC(即平方可公度而长度不可公度)组成矩形 AC;我说AC要么有理,要么中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"003ec521d6bf7c2d7a17f80ed2169174a732837bf459c042df35be16fbebeef2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on AB, BC let the squares AD, BE be described; therefore each of the squares AD, BE is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC,正方形,AD,BE,因此,正方形,AD,BE,各为中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"119c6160a0a4d0c689ef7d629cc3cd6f881b28c574e7aeb0adcc27f5735724ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line FG be set out, to FG let there be applied the rectangular parallelogram GH equal to AD, producing FH as breadth, to HM let there be applied the rectangular parallelogram MK equal to AC, producing HK as breadth, and further to KN let there be similarly applied NL equal to BE, producing KL as breadth; therefore FH, HK, KL are in a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 FG设为FG,将矩形平行四边形 GH设为AD,将宽度FH扩大为HM,将矩形平行四边形 MK设为AC,将宽度HK,再设为KN,将矩形NL设为BE,将宽度KL,因此,FH,HK,KL设为直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e4080f39d5251253862e9695212be164a8692c3ac39f1e2b16153ac87c5bd6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then each of the squares AD, BE is medial, and AD is equal to GH, and BE to NL, therefore each of the rectangles GH, NL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,正方形 AD中,BE为中项无理线段,AD等于GH,BE等于NL,因此,矩形 GH中,NL也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"becde7efd3b85b9ff3ed0bfeee23df6370060982127f3132e2533265be2d399a","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are applied to the rational straight line FG; therefore each of the straight lines FH, KL is rational and incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 FG;因此,FH直线、KL直线和不可公度直线各长FG。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1646c14494cf3b5fddbaf5b58d12364f46e83bfb886ed0f2a765a8965f43f6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AD is commensurable with BE, therefore GH is also commensurable with NL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD是可公度,BE,GH也是可公度,NL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11ccdfa08ab8bddfb403b692325ecb59615165e78d551757c63fe2f0cab95922","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as GH is to NL, so is FH to KL; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore FH is commensurable in length with KL. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH比NL等于FH比KL,因此FH比GH比KL；GH 与 NL 之比等于 FH 与 KL 之比；上述对应量可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f0aa034be8b2607818b5799f5bbcb5fb2b4814e03cb5f77f68639e4c35a3a4a","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FH, KL are rational straight lines commensurable in length; therefore the rectangle FH, KL is rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH,KL是有理线段,长度可公度;因此,矩形,FH,KL是有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d5d9be24c6c04699d4f87fb61124b138230bdac1778b023294c30b3f91a260b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DB is equal to BA, and OB to BC, therefore, as DB is to BC, so is AB to BO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DB等于BA,OB比BC,DB比BC等于AB比BO；DB 与 BC 之比等于 AB 与 BO 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b407faacc28feefb1e444303e29bc22eb17cad12811edaf8c6413e7d5956a555","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as DB is to BC, so is DA to AC, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and, as AB is to BO, so is AC to CO; [id.] therefore, as DA is to AC, so is AC to CO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,DB对BC的比等于DA对AC的比,AB对BO的比等于AC对CO的比;因此,DA对AC的比等于CO的比；DB 与 BC 之比等于 DA 与 AC 之比；AB 与 BO 之比等于 AC 与 CO 之比；DA 与 AC 之比等于 AC 与 CO 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2b195a36dde1a1c02440adda65cd25f7a98cae32dc7b09d6c06a0fbf232b3d5","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AD is equal to GH, AC to MK and CO to NL; therefore, as GH is to MK, so is MK to NL; therefore also, as FH is to HK, so is HK to KL; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore the rectangle FH, KL is equal to the square on HK. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AD等于GH,AC至MK,CO至NL;因此,GH至MK的比等于MK至NL;因此,FH至HK的比等于HK至KL;因此,矩形 FH、KL的比等于HK的正方形；GH 与 MK 之比等于 MK 与 NL 之比；FH 与 HK 之比等于 HK 与 KL 之比。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11) [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73c25fff9578b94513535818b56d76549da0e148eade3f02dcc1a97cfcbe8c58","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle FH, KL is rational; therefore the square on HK is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 FH,KL是有理,因此HK的正方形也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b4758fab5f6bb43f41710bab4aa86e638983eaeaec4961f35bce6c773be3c62","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore HK is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以HK是有理"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9eea1147c1be790edc734818b6ffa3dd45184a3e83d0fb087bf6bf415c77cdc1","citations":["euclid-10-19","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if it is commensurable in length with FG, HN is rational; [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)] but, if it is incommensurable in length with FG, KH, HM are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and therefore HN is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果是长度可公度和FG,HN是有理;如果是不可公度,FG,KH,HM是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,中项无理线段。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80cbf76df9cca32a71883933b6b665ec1a6f5503be42be007c8fd3d2574632b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore HN is either rational or medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HN是有理或中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b08ecd09846625c37f43aa9758e803d684a88aeeb9c1eb877d97b8facd821b78","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But HN is equal to AC; therefore AC is either rational or medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HN等于AC,因此AC等于有理或中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-25.source","contentId":"euclid-10-25","revisionId":"euclid-10-25@raw-d8e1e81d312c4fcb","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d63ca53f9454737f0f88b4a3737aab3898da744962a3a23947b778375c4d78d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"X. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.5","euclid-10-25.proof.8","euclid-10-25.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"X. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.6","euclid-10-25.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"X. 19"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-6-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"VI. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.25/","sourceLabel":"X. 21"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-22:explicit","id":"euclid-10-22","book":10,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-6-1:explicit","id":"euclid-6-1","book":6,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"同高三角形与平行四边形的面积比等于底边比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-11:explicit","id":"euclid-10-11","book":10,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例关系保持可公度与不可公度","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-19:explicit","id":"euclid-10-19","book":10,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-5-11:explicit","id":"euclid-5-11","book":5,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例相等的传递性","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-6-17:explicit","id":"euclid-6-17","book":6,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"三直线为连比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等首尾线矩内直角形与中线…","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-10-21:explicit","id":"euclid-10-21","book":10,"number":21,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与中项无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-irrational","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
